## Final Mental Model

Keep these six concepts connected like this:

```text
 Python source code
        ↓
    Compilation
        ↓
  ┌───────────────┐
  │ Syntax check  │ ────── (SyntaxError prevents execution here)
  └───────────────┘
        ↓
    Code Object
        ↓
  ┌─────────────────────┐
  │ bytecode + co_consts│ ────── (Constants/literals stored here)
  └─────────────────────┘
        ↓
  Python execution ────── (RuntimeError can happen here)
        ↓
  Runtime values/objects
        ↓
  ┌─────────────────────┐
  │ String interning    │ ────── (Reuse of identical strings)
  │ Integer caching     │ ────── (Reuse of small integers)
  └─────────────────────┘

```
